<title>USA: New Jersey EFA, won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>New Jersey EFA, won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $22.115 million of New Jersey Educational Facilities Auth., princeton theological seminary issue, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost of 4.98 percent.</p>
</text>
